==Battleground==
*3 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*4 [[Znache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Zomboe]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kory]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 33.33~43.33 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 36.67~43.33 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,300f</sup>.
**2 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Zombies don't pose much of a challenge, and the Celeboodles provide you with ample cash. Just swarm the enemies with [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cats]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cats]] to clear the field of Zombies, then lure Kory to your base and get rid of him with a combination of Island Cats + [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cats]], and [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]]. Celeboodles deal high damage, so try to deal with them as soon as they show up.

